    "description": "You can fuel your mastery of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> with your own vitality. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can move -1 step down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> to gain a temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>. This temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> lasts until the end of your turn, at which point it is lost if it has not been used.",
